---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
---
<Layout title='Work — Jennie Muso' description='Selected websites by Jennie Muso: Verya Cargo, Bayline Dubai, Jin Restaurant, and Nacre Dental.' current='work' styles={['fonts.css','styles.css','editorial.css','projects.css','reference-layout.css','refinements.css']} bodyClass="work-page">
<div class="page-intro"><h1>THE WORK.</h1><p>Four websites. Four very different businesses. Each one starts with the same question: what does this audience need to feel, understand, and do?</p></div><section class="work" id="work" aria-label="Selected websites"><div class="section-head"><h2>Selected work</h2></div><div class="work-grid">
<article class="work-item work-item-a"><div class="work-media"><img src="/assets/verya.jpg" alt="Editorial cargo ship photograph representing Verya Cargo" loading="lazy"></div><div class="work-caption"><h3>Verya Cargo</h3><span>Website design & development</span></div></article>
<article class="work-item work-item-b"><div class="work-media"><img src="/assets/bayline.jpg" alt="Editorial Dubai architecture photograph representing Bayline" loading="lazy"></div><div class="work-caption"><h3>Bayline Dubai</h3><span>Website design & development</span></div></article>
<article class="work-item work-item-c"><div class="work-media"><img src="/assets/jin.jpg" alt="Editorial chef photograph representing Jin Restaurant" loading="lazy"></div><div class="work-caption"><h3>Jin Restaurant</h3><span>Website design & development</span></div></article>
<article class="work-item work-item-d"><div class="work-media"><img src="/assets/nacre.jpg" alt="Editorial dental studio photograph representing Nacre Dental" loading="lazy"></div><div class="work-caption"><h3>Nacre Dental</h3><span>Website design & development</span></div></article>
</div><div class="work-end"><p class="work-note">Tools in my workflow: Astro, Cloudflare, Resend, and GitHub. Project-specific stack details will accompany the case studies.</p><a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Discuss a project <Icon name="ArrowUpRight" size={20} /></a></div></section>
</Layout>
